<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JAN 10.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JAN 10.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Friday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Jan 10	Jan 09	Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  245.940     247.290     247.020   -0.44 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  303.160     304.160     306.830   -1.20 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  155.950     156.585     158.970   -1.90 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.240	46.376	47.182   -2.00 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  414.560     418.180     419.180   -1.10 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  138.970     139.495     141.685   -1.92 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.986	16.001	16.185   -1.23 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  213.000     212.460     212.430    0.27 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.863	 1.863	 1.888   -1.32 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.563	 1.565	 1.581   -1.14 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  179.370     181.455     183.135   -2.06 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the January</p>
<p>02, 1997 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
